# CLI Reference

Reference for all registered CLIs in [`pyproject.toml`]({{ page.pyproject_url }}) (`[project.scripts]`).

- **Local execution**: `uv run <cli_command> [OPTIONS]`
- **Container execution**: [`./scripts/entrypoint.sh`]({{ page.entrypoint_url }}) `pipeline <cli_command> [OPTIONS]`
- **Environment variables**: Every CLI option can also be configured via its `CDL_*` environment variable.
- **Execution and CTS semantics**: See [Core Pipeline and KBase CTS Execution Guide](core_cts_execution.md).

